### Register
POST http://127.0.0.1:8001/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"new.user@example.local","password":"StrongPass123!"}

### Login
POST http://127.0.0.1:8001/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"analyst@example.local","password":"Lab5Password!"}

### Verify token and active Redis session
GET http://127.0.0.1:8001/auth/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Logout removes Redis session
POST http://127.0.0.1:8001/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
